{"id":"method-function-equality","html":"<section class=\"contract\" id=\"contract\"><h2>什么时候用</h2><dl><dt>适合什么题</dt><dd>一对来源明确的实函数或多组待比较函数。</dd><dt>最后要得到什么</dt><dd>每项的相同或不同判定及证明；选择题按原题极性汇总标签。</dd><dt>要注意</dt><dd>限一个实自变量、固定有理系数。支持至多二次多项式、abs(Q)、原式为sqrt(Q^2)、顶层P+abs(Q)（两项可换序）、显式(Q*L)/L（乘积因子可换序），以及原有仿射根式的平方；P、Q至多二次，L为非恒零仿射式且与被约因子系数一致。需判号的Q允许无实根、重根、退化与恒零；有实零点时全部为有理数。支持全实数域、有理端点区间、单点域及从这些集合一次去掉不超过16个有理点。所有原分母限制保留；一般四次根式、展开后的任意有理式约分、含参或复杂嵌套不在当前范围。</dd></dl></section><section id=\"path\"><h2>解题步骤</h2><p class=\"muted\">按顺序做。标了条件的技能，只在题目符合那个条件时才用。</p><ol class=\"method-path\" aria-label=\"解题步骤\"><li id=\"prepare\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><h3>整理比较对象</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#prepare\" aria-label=\"定位到整理比较对象\">#</a></div><p>按原选项保存各自函数、输入限制和比较要求。</p></li><li id=\"options\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><h3>进入本组选项</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#options\" aria-label=\"定位到进入本组选项\">#</a></div><p>每次只比较一组函数，记录属于本项的证据。</p></li><li id=\"left-domain\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><h3>确定第一个函数的定义域</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#left-domain\" aria-label=\"定位到确定第一个函数的定义域\">#</a></div><p>保留原式限制，借用列条件求交集法确定自然定义域。</p><div class=\"step-calls is-inline\"><p class=\"rel-label\">这一步用到</p><ul><li><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-domain-intersection/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>列条件求交集法</a></li></ul></div></li><li id=\"right-domain\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">4</span><h3>确定第二个函数的定义域</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#right-domain\" aria-label=\"定位到确定第二个函数的定义域\">#</a></div><p>在本项上下文中确定另一个函数的定义域，再返回本项比较。</p><div class=\"step-calls is-inline\"><p class=\"rel-label\">这一步用到</p><ul><li><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-domain-intersection/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>列条件求交集法</a></li></ul></div></li><li id=\"compare\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">5</span><h3>比较定义域与对应关系</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#compare\" aria-label=\"定位到比较定义域与对应关系\">#</a></div><p>定义域不同给出差异输入；定义域相同时证明全域输出一致，或给出有效反例。</p><div class=\"step-calls is-inline\"><p class=\"rel-label\">这一步用到</p><ul><li><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"skill\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/skill-simplify/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>代数式化简</a></li></ul></div></li><li id=\"collect\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">6</span><h3>收集各项判定</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#collect\" aria-label=\"定位到收集各项判定\">#</a></div><p>全部选项都有有效判定后，才按题目要求汇总。</p></li><li id=\"verify\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">7</span><h3>核验完整比较结果</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#verify\" aria-label=\"定位到核验完整比较结果\">#</a></div><p>独立核对原式定义域、完整恒等证明或反例以及选项归属。</p></li></ol></section><section id=\"basis\"><h2>背后用到的知识</h2><p class=\"muted\">上面各步骤用到的性质和公式。做一道具体的题，通常只用到其中一部分。</p><div class=\"chips\"><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/equality-properties/#identity\">等式的性质 · 等值替换与定义域</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/inequality-properties/#addition\">不等式的性质 · 同加减与同向相加</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/inequality-properties/#multiplication\">不等式的性质 · 乘除与方向</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/inequality-properties/#reciprocal\">不等式的性质 · 同号两数取倒数</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/integer-power/#positive-exponent\">整数幂 · 正整数次幂</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/integer-power/#zero-exponent\">整数幂 · 零次幂与底数限制</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/rational-expression/#meaning\">分式 · 有意义与值为零</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/real-order/#difference\">不等式与实数大小关系 · 作差判号</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/square-root-expression/#meaning\">二次根式 · 有意义的条件与算术平方根</a></div></section><section id=\"examples\"><h2>例题</h2><article class=\"example\"><h3>1. 逐组判断同一函数</h3><p class=\"problem\">下列哪些组表示同一函数？A：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(x)=(\\sqrt{x})^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"hei